\par\par \b \uc2  Argentina cenbank should keep peso in adequate margin. \b0\par\par\uc2 248 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2002\par 14:04\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUENOS AIRES, March 12 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to keep the recently floated local peso \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  within "adequate margins" after it fell by more than half against the dollar, President Eduardo Duhalde said on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  A recession since mid-1998 led Argentina to default on part of its $141 billion debt in January followed by a messy \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  devaluation after more than a decade of parity to the dollar. The government fully floated the peso last month and it closed Monday at 2.30/2.32 (buy/sell rate) against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will take the steps it needs to take so the peso does not sink, this is known, it has not participated, it has not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  and I think from what I understand it is time to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep it in adequate margins," Duhalde told local radio. \par \par \uc2  Duhalde, sworn in as Argentina's fifth president in January after riots and looting forced elected president Fernando de la Rua to resign in late December, said he decided to devalue the peso to make the country's exports cheaper on world markets. \par \par \uc2  The devaluation has also caused a strain on the cash-strapped financial system because of a mismatch in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate the government imposed on assets and liabilities. Unpopular banking curbs in place since December remain in order to avoid a collapse of the financial sector. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020312dy3c00pmu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
