\par\par \b \uc2  Argentina's Ctrl Bank Drops Two Restrictions On Dollars \b0\par\par\uc2 218 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2002\par 22:59\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    BUENOS AIRES -(Dow Jones)- Argentina's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2    said Monday\par that companies will no longer have to seek its prior approval before\par servicing debts with foreign banks and bondholders or making payments\par to overseas suppliers.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Those restrictions have been in place in some form since Dec. 3, when\par former economy minister Domingo Cavallo initiated monthly limits on bank\par account withdrawals and overseas capital transfers to end a yearlong run\par on bank deposits and prevent a collapse of the financial system.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  Still restricted for the next 60 days are the overseas transfers of company profits and dividends. Those limits are scheduled to be lifted May 11, the original deadline set on Feb. 11, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said. \par \par \uc2  In addition, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officially rescinded its Feb. 8 order for all local banks to sell it their Feb. 1 dollar holdings. \par \par \uc2  At the time, local commercial banks objected to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's demand and enforcement of the order was suspended. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's reported failure to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets during most of the last week has resulted in the U.S. dollar climbing to a record high against the peso of ARS2.31. \par \par \uc2  -By Tim Loughran, Dow Jones Newswires; 5411-4313-1918; argentina@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020311dy3b0018r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
