hlight\uc2  reserves as necessary to keep the greenback at about ARS1.60-ARS1.70. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  -By Tim Loughran, Dow Jones Newswires; 5411-4313-1918;\par tim.loughran@dowjones.com\par -0-\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par APDJ-02-21-02 1431GMT<\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020221dy2l01cdf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
