\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Argentina \highlight\uc2  peso ends up on  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 , stocks dip. \b0\par\par\uc2      By Jorge A. Otaola \par \uc2 398 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Januar 2002\par 23:22\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      BUENOS AIRES, \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Jan 23 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \par \par \uc2  peso strengthened on Wednesday as another \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  helped keep the \par \par \uc2  unit stable despite market jitters, traders said. \par \par \uc2      Meanwhile, the stock market slumped 1.56 percent as traders \par \par \uc2  took profits on some of the MerVal's gains over the last two \par \par \uc2  months. \par \par \uc2      Traders said the peso closed at an average 1.74/1.77 per \par \par \uc2  dollar for large-scale transactions in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  market, firmer than Tuesday's close of 1.80/1.85. \par \par \uc2      The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market for the seventh \par \par \uc2  straight session, selling an unspecified amount of dollars at \par \par \uc2  1.62 to prop up the peso, the bank said. \par \par \uc2      "The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's participation has succeeded in \par \par \uc2  controlling the dollar's offering price," a trader said. \par \par \uc2      Traders also said the peso's value remained strong due to \par \par \uc2  capital controls on banks that have effectively reduced the \par \par \uc2  amount of cash in circulation. \par \par \uc2      "Small savers continue trying to protect their assets by \par \par \uc2  buying dollars in small