l companies," one trader said. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the market shrugged off news that the Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  cut is 2002 growth forecast on Wednesday to 3.3 percent from 5 percent. The revised outlook had long been discounted, they said. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020116dy1g01726\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
