\par\par \b \uc2  Brazil Real Ends Stronger On Argentina's Sigh Of Relief \b0\par\par\uc2 347 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Juli 2001\par 22:32\par \uc2  Dow Jones Commodities Service \par \uc2 DJCS\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO -(Dow Jones)- The Brazilian real got a lift Friday from a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and signs that \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2  is securing increasing political support for a crisis-fighting austerity plan. \par \par \uc2  Traders added inflows, and the expectation of more dollars entering the Brazilian market next week also cheered the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The real ended at a midrate of BRR2.452 per dollar on a spread of BRR2.451-BRR2.453 after hitting a high of BRR2.433 per dollar after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars on the market to prop up the real. \par \par \uc2  This compares with the real's Thursday's closing mark of BRR2.508 per dollar. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market but didn't say how much it sold. \par \par \uc2  Traders said about $140 million from Volkswagen (G.VOW) export contracts entered the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Friday, giving the real a boost. \par \par \uc2  "Investors are also expecting dollars from the Petrobras share offer to come into Brazil next week, as well as dollars from Petrobras's insurance policy for the P-36," said a Rio de Janeiro based trader, referring to a Petrobras oil rig that sank in March. \par \par \uc2  On Thursday, Brazil's National Development Bank BNDES said it raised a total of BRR1.73 billion from the sale of 41.4 million nonvoting shares it had in oil giant Petrobras for $19.50 per share. \par \par \uc2  Out of that total, $596.7 million make up the share offer's international portion, which is expected to enter the market next Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Moreover, the market also expects Petrobras to receive an expected $496.75 million from an insurance contract for the loss of its P-36 oil platform. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said international reserves were slightly lower at $36.008 billion on Thursday, from $36.018 billion Wednesday. International reserve figures are available on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's website {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bcb.gov.br/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.bcb.gov.br}}}\uc2  with a one-day lag. \par \par \uc2  -By Adriana Brasileiro, Dow Jones Newswires; (5521) 9965-1193; adriana.brasieiro@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument djcs000020010720dx7k00fwb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
