the share offer's international portion, which is expected to enter the market next Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Moreover, the market also expects Petrobras to receive an expected $496.75 million from an insurance contract for the loss of its P-36 oil platform. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said international reserves were slightly lower at $36.008 billion on Thursday, from $36.018 billion Wednesday. International reserve figures are available on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's website {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bcb.gov.br/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.bcb.gov.br}}}\uc2  with a one-day lag. \par \par \uc2  -By Adriana Brasileiro, Dow Jones Newswires; (5521) 9965-1193; adriana.brasieiro@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010720dx7k003pd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
